an class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>。总占用时长为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{busy}(W) = \\sum_{k} (e_k - s_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">busy</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里用的是<strong>半开区间</strong>：相邻块 <code>10:00–11:00</code> 与 <code>11:00–12:00</code> 应当合并成一个两小时忙碌块，而闭区间写法会算成两个各占一小时的块并额外引入一个零长度间隙。这正是 <code>DTEND</code> 非包含语义的直接后果。超长区间（如跨越数月的维护窗口）必须在展开阶段设上限，否则忙闲查询会退化成长时间扫描——展开规则见 <a href=\"../rrule-recurrence-expansion/rrule-grammar-semantics\">RRULE 文法与语义</a>，事件的组件结构见 <a href=\"../icalendar-model-timezone/icalendar-rfc5545-component-model\">iCalendar RFC 5545 组件模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"caldav-free-busy-query-与商业-api-的落地差异\">CalDAV free-busy-query 与商业 API 的落地差异</h2><p>CalDAV（RFC 4791 §7.10）定义了一个 <code>free-busy-query</code> REPORT：客户端 POST 一段 <code>&lt;C:free-busy-query&gt;&lt;C:time-range start=&quot;...&quot; end=&quot;...&quot;/&gt;&lt;/C:free-busy-query&gt;</code>，服务端返回 <code>200 OK</code> 加一段 <code>text/calendar</code> 的 <code>VFREEBUSY</code>。它把「推导忙闲」的责任放在服务端，客户端拿到的就是归一后的区间，无需自己解析每个事件。RFC 6638 进一步把忙闲查询纳入 CalDAV 调度扩展，使服务端之间也能直接交换忙闲。</p>\n<p>现实里这条路径的可用性参差：自建服务（SabreDAV 等）通常实现了该 REPORT，而部分商业日历的 CalDAV 端点在忙闲上报上有额外限制或干脆不暴露，工程上更常走厂商 API。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>接口</th>\n<th>请求形态</th>\n<th>返回粒度</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CalDAV <code>free-busy-query</code></td>\n<td>REPORT + <code>time-range</code></td>\n<td><code>VFREEBUSY</code> 的 <code>PERIOD</code> 列表</td>\n<td>RFC 4791 §7.10；服务端可返回已合并区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Calendar API <code>freebusy.query</code></td>\n<td>POST <code>timeMin</code> / <code>timeMax</code> + 日历 ID 列表</td>\n<td>每日历的 <code>busy[]</code>（<code>start</code> / <code>end</code>）</td>\n<td>返回 <code>errors[]</code> 标识不可读日历，须按日历降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Microsoft Graph <code>getSchedule</code></td>\n<td>POST <code>schedules</code> + <code>availabilityViewInterval</code></td>\n<td><code>availabilityView</code> 位串 + <code>scheduleItems</code></td>\n<td>每字符一个时间槽：<code>0</code> 空闲、<code>1</code> 暂定、<code>2</code> 忙、<code>3</code> 带外、<code>4</code> 异地办公</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Graph 把忙闲<strong>量化成固定宽度的时间槽</strong>（<code>availabilityViewInterval</code> 默认 30 分钟），这与 <code>PERIOD</code> 的连续区间模型是两种表示：槽位表示便于用位运算找连续空档，但会丢失跨槽边界的精度；<code>PERIOD</code> 表示精确，却需要调用方自己做区间合并。跨系统同步时，把槽位还原成 <code>PERIOD</code> 必须保留时区基准，否则跨槽的会议会被四舍五入吞掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可见性-隐私与忙闲泄漏面\">可见性、隐私与忙闲泄漏面</h2><p>忙闲查询的隐私边界不在「给不给数据」，而在「给到什么粒度」。一个被广泛采用的默认是：私人日程 <code>CLASS:PRIVATE</code> 对外投影为匿名 <code>BUSY</code>。但即使抹掉标题，<strong>忙碌区间的起止时刻本身仍是可推断信息</strong>——一周内每天 12:00–13:00 的固定忙碌块足以推断用餐习惯与所在时区；深夜连续的 <code>BUSY</code> 能推断协作方的工作制度。因此忙闲接口应按个人数据的读接口来设计：只返回本次排期所需的最小窗口，不做全量导出，并对查询者身份做鉴权。</p>\n<p>RFC 7953 提供了另一种建模视角：<code>VAVAILABILITY</code> 组件配合 <code>AVAILABLE</code> 子组件，直接声明「我在哪些时段可被安排」，并用 <code>PRIORITY</code> 表示可用性等级的优先级。它与 <code>VFREEBUSY</code>（声明「我什么时候忙」）互为补集，表达营业时间、值班表、定期可用窗口时更省事——同一份日历对亚太与欧美同事往往需要暴露不同的可用窗口，用 <code>VAVAILABILITY</code> 比在每个事件上打 <code>TRANSP</code> 更清晰。</p>\n<p>落到合规层面，忙闲数据在多数司法辖区属于个人数据：仅因业务需要查询同事忙闲，也应有明确的合法依据与保留期限。工程上最稳的做法是<strong>在服务端做投影</strong>——客户端永远拿不到原始事件，只能拿到已按身份裁剪过的区间集合，于是 <code>TRANSP</code>、<code>STATUS</code>、<code>CLASS</code> 的组合语义只在一个地方实现，也就只有一个地方会出错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>TRANSP</code> 决定是否占用（默认 <code>OPAQUE</code> 占用），<code>STATUS</code> 决定确定性，<code>CLASS</code> 决定可见性——三者正交，必须分别建模。</li>\n<li><code>FREEBUSY</code> 的值是 <code>PERIOD</code>（<code>start/end</code> 或 <code>start/duration</code>），其中的时刻<strong>必须是 UTC</strong>，<code>FBTYPE</code> 缺省为 <code>BUSY</code>。</li>\n<li><code>VFREEBUSY</code> 是忙闲查询的独立载体，靠 iTIP（RFC 5546）在组织者与被查询方之间往返，不经事件落地。</li>\n<li>忙闲推导是半开区间的筛选、裁剪与归并：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[s,e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 语义下相邻区间应合并，<code>DTEND</code> 非包含是这一切的根源。</li>\n<li>CalDAV 的 <code>free-busy-query</code> REPORT 把推导放在服务端；Google <code>freebusy.query</code> 返回 <code>PERIOD</code> 列表，Graph <code>getSchedule</code> 返回固定宽度时间槽，精度取舍不同。</li>\n<li>忙碌区间的起止时刻即可推断行为规律，忙闲接口应按个人数据读接口设计：最小窗口、鉴权、服务端投影。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"忙闲数据模型：VFreeBusy、FREEBUSY 区间与 TRANSP/可见性语义","id":"忙闲数据模型-vfreebusy-freebusy-区间与-transp-可见性语义"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：占用语义与可见性语义的分层","id":"核心概念-占用语义与可见性语义的分层"},{"level":2,"text":"TRANSP 与 STATUS：事件到占用语义的第一层映射","id":"transp-与-status-事件到占用语义的第一层映射"},{"level":2,"text":"FREEBUSY 的取值文法：PERIOD 与 FBTYPE","id":"freebusy-的取值文法-period-与-fbtype"},{"level":2,"text":"VFREEBUSY 组件与 iTIP 忙闲查询流程","id":"vfreebusy-组件与-itip-忙闲查询流程"},{"level":2,"text":"从日历推导忙闲：半开区间代数与窗口裁剪","id":"从日历推导忙闲-半开区间代数与窗口裁剪"},{"level":2,"text":"CalDAV free-busy-query 与商业 API 的落地差异","id":"caldav-free-busy-query-与商业-api-的落地差异"},{"level":2,"text":"可见性、隐私与忙闲泄漏面","id":"可见性-隐私与忙闲泄漏面"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"有界窗口物化与展开性能：无限规则、缓存与 DST/DoS 边界处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/calendar-scheduling-icalendar-rrule-caldav-availability/rrule-recurrence-expansion/recurrence-window-materialization-perf"},"next":{"title":"可用性计算：时区归一、区间合并与工作时间/缓冲窗口代数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/calendar-scheduling-icalendar-rrule-caldav-availability/freebusy-availability-scheduling/availability-interval-algebra"}}